WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.310
A boss battle never lasts only one round!

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.310
Sir!

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:06.520
Stay back!

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.940
Get out of here, fools!

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.650
But—

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.480
Wait!

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.740
Yuuri, you can't help him!

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.700
But he's injured!

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.410
He's making the right decision.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.830
Yuuri, you need to get through this alive

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.450
to see Riria, right?

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.170
I know they're all right.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.380
But since I'm not smart like they are...

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.590
It all just sounds like excuses to me!

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.880
I don't want to make excuses
to abandon someone!

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:35.970
Yuuri!

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.100
Yuuri means well.

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:43.270
But she has a hard time evaluating
immediate situations.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.770
The rest of you should get back to base.

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.200
Wh-What are you doing, Yuuri?!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.320
I came to save you, obviously!

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:15.130
Well, well! He's back.

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:50.230
Episode 7  "Tyrant"

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.560
What will I do with you, Yuuri?

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:51.270
Akira! You came!

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.480
We're partners, like I said.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.240
I'll get through this...

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:05.780
So that I can fight you again.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.750
Fools! Why did you come back?

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.460
I've come up with a plan.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.750
Just watch.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.090
Yuuri, I have an idea.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:18.960
Hear me out.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:20.380
Let's go, Yuuri!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.220
Right!

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:25.970
Akira, what's your idea?

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.430
All or nothing!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.640
Yuuri, listen as you keep fighting!

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.560
Akira!

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.740
No way! We haven't even practiced!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:42.820
We just have to do it!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.860
If we want to beat this thing...

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.740
The leader's attention is focused on me.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.410
So I just need to find a
place out of their sight...

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.840
Over there, maybe?

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.130
Yuuri! Let's do it!

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.430
Akira! Are you serious about this?

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.680
If we get this wrong...

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.100
Don't worry! I trust you!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:10.390
Let's go!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:15.100
Their attacks don't faze it.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.730
Are they stupid or something?

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:17.110
No.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.570
I think they may have a plan.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:23.990
Not yet...

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.160
Okay!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.420
Yuuri!

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:42.170
Now!

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:46.590
Akira!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.020
Finally got in close.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.780
What?!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.990
Akira!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.870
You did it, you idiot!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.000
You really scared me.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.330
Never do anything so dangerous again!

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:17.920
Yuuri?

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:26.760
It's not over yet!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:27.970
Yuuri!

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.220
Akira!

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.400
Interesting.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.860
The leader of Team Red...

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.030
I see.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:48.280
So the cannon works if you
fire it into its mouth.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:52.870
Did you dodge that final
blow out of pure dumb luck?

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.250
You're an interesting pair.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.660
Very interesting!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.830
I haven't felt this way in a long time!

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.170
What's so funny?

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:07.050
You're the ones responsible for all of this!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.470
What are you laughing about?!

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:15.350
That won't work.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.060
Yuuri!

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:25.360
The ghouls are finished
and the quest is over.

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:27.950
You want to fight me next?

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:30.160
Two on one...

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:34.030
Or three on one if Old Man
Shirasagi is still up for it.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.790
C'mon. Get up.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:36.830
Let's do this.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:40.830
Mion...

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.500
Those calls aren't for you to make, Ichi.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.050
<i>I</i> haven't declared the quest over yet.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.380
I don't care! You can't stop me now!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.550
Calm down now, Ichi.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:55.260
I didn't tell you not to fight.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.140
Hup!

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:01.100
After all, I do think both
sides crossed the line.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.730
You're not about to back
off either, are you?

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.020
You bet we're not!

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.070
Mion... What are you getting at?

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:11.030
How would you feel about an
even more exciting quest?

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.700
A fight-your-heart-out battle game
between Team Red and Team Green,

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.830
with survival on the line!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.120
I call it "Hunt the King!"

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.000
Hunt the King?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.210
What's that supposed to be?

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.590
A very simple quest.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.550
We break you into two teams in the field,

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:30.670
and whoever hunts down the
other team's leader wins.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.300
It's a fun and exciting war game!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.390
War "game," eh?

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:38.270
Is "hunts" meant literally?

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:43.230
"Hunts" in this quest refers not to
the opponent but their interface.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.690
Do whatever it takes to
steal their interface,

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:49.190
and connect it to yours!

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.280
When you do, the hunt is complete!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.200
Can a farce like that even have a point?

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.240
If it didn't, it wouldn't be a quest.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:08:00.500
It being a quest means that I'll intervene.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.040
Hunting an enemy gets you points,

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:07.590
and as a little bonus, I'll make
the enemy king easier to hunt!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.630
For instance... I could activate
their cuffs and seal their abilities!

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:16.800
In other words, render the
enemy team leader powerless...

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.390
...allowing them to be killed.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:24.980
You've been in quite a deadlock due
to the other leader's ability.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:30.940
But a merciless engagement in this quest
should bring you to a resolution.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:35.660
Red and Green... one or the other will fall.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:38.450
So if we play your little game,

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.830
we can smash that annoying Team Green

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:44.290
and force old man Shirasagi to his knees?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.420
What do you think, Kuro?

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.500
What do you think I think?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.380
I'm tired of going along with this nonsense.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:54.170
But if we have to do it,
I'll give it my all.

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.220
You said this would bring
us to a resolution...

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.010
Throw in a guarantee that will be the case.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:08:59.850
How so?

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.430
Capturing the king doesn't
just end the game.

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:06.810
If we win, everyone on Team Green dies!

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:10.150
That would be a proper resolution, wouldn't it?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:11.650
What a good idea!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:13.320
Don't be absurd!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.610
We have children and the
elderly on our side!

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.490
They have nothing to do with this battle!

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.620
None of that, now!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:25.040
Neither Red nor Green has any
right to speak right now.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.580
If you refuse my terms,

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:30.500
you'll have to fight the
uninjured Team Red right now.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.420
Those two who came to save you will die.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.130
It's decided.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.760
Team Red versus Team Green...

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:42.600
And you have the Mion guarantee that
everyone on the losing team will die!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:47.480
The battle quest "Hunt the King"
will begin in seven days!

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.110
Hurry! We've got lots of injured!

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:54.230
Burn all the wood we have to heat up water!

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:55.940
We don't have enough wood.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.070
Anyone free, help out!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.700
I have to help, too!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.870
How are the injured doing?

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.040
They're fine!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.500
I'm more impressed that
you've returned, sir!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.290
I owe it to these two.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.540
You're a mess, Yuuri.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.170
We'll prepare a shower and a hot bath,
so please avail yourself of them.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:17.680
For real?

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.630
We can?

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.930
Of course!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.050
You saved our leader's life!

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:23.180
Akira...

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:25.470
Once I'm patched up, come by my room.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.140
I have to talk to you.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.110
That bastard...

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.280
How's your arm?

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.080
Are you sure you shouldn't rest first?

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:50.080
No, I need to tell everyone
about the new quest at once.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.790
But first, I have to ask you something.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.550
What is your real ability?

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.930
I saw that ghoul's attack crush you.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:03.690
You couldn't have dodged it out of luck.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:07.140
Just what did you do then?

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.600
You're right.

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.070
My real ability isn't the cannon.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.610
But that's all I can tell you.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:22.030
Just as you hide things from
even your trusted partners,

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.950
I have a reason for not
revealing my real ability.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.620
But I will use this ability
to crush Team Red.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.670
I promise you that.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:39.880
Damn you... Don't you
know that I'm Team Red?

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.550
Red?

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.550
I know nothing about you,

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:47.350
but no decent person would
attack a child in a forest.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.230
I first learned of him in
an online debate game.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:55.360
I thought I was pretty good at the game,

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.690
but Key completely crushed me.

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:01.650
Ever since, I was a fan of Key.

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.620
From a foreign magazine,
I learned that Key's real name

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:06.830
was Akira Shiroyanagi.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.580
Key...

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.540
I always wanted to meet the person
on the other side of that game.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.290
Hareka!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:15.960
I was so worried!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.250
What were you doing?

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.130
I wanted to help,

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.720
so I went to gather firewood.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.470
And who are you?

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:26.510
Um...

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:29.100
He saved me, actually.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:29.890
Kumagiri!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.270
Akira?

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.940
Hey, it's Kumagiri!

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.230
Yuuri! You're safe?

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:38.980
You bet I am!

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:41.320
We found each other after all.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.280
Ya know him?

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:46.030
Yeah.

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.450
He was on our team in the second program.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.160
He might be a meathead, but he's nice.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:53.000
I'm so sorry!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:56.290
Everyone's kind of on edge right now.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.880
I tried to tell you!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.800
It's understandable.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.630
Are you a friend of Akira's?

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.760
You're safe here.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.300
You can make yourself at home.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.970
Though that'll only be for a week.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.390
Bing-bong-bing-bong!

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:13.350
Sweet li'l Mion has a wonderful
announcement for all of you!

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:17.810
Seven days from now, the existence of the
Red and Green teams will be laid on the line!

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:21.230
We'll be running a battle
game called "Hunt the King"

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:24.400
in which I personally guarantee that
everyone on the losing team will die!

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.860
Last-minute entrants are encouraged!

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:29.330
Let's make this quest fun, everyone!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.080
You heard her.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:35.290
But this quest is also
an opportunity for us.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:39.750
There's a chance that we'll be able to seal
the ability of Team Red's leader, Oogami,

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.000
whom we couldn't take out
under ordinary conditions.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.380
We have a chance to win.

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:47.340
Let's at least restore the natural human order!

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:49.550
Everyone, help me!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:54.020
This is what Mion wanted from the start.

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:56.390
Force the teams out of their stalemate

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:57.390
and make them fight.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.860
And while everyone was
playing into Mion's hands,

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:06.320
their sub-leader had the idea to use
her to get rid of everyone in his way.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.110
He's the most dangerous one here.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.040
In the next seven days...

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:17.080
What can I do? What should<i> I do?</i>

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:19.960
Excuse me...

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.420
You're...

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:24.630
I'm Ringo Tatara.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.090
I wanted to show my gratitude.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.260
Thank you so much.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.260
Sure.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.220
I see you're safe. I'm glad.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:33.680
It's the second time.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:37.100
The first time was that unpleasant man...

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.390
Kirisaki, you mean?

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:40.810
I was just teasing him.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.150
And, um...

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.280
What are you doing?

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.240
You have to tell him!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.780
You're not just here to thank him!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:50.490
Well, I need to think some things over.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:54.280
Wait! I have to talk to you!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.160
Go for it, Ringo!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.620
Keep cool, like you always do!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.250
Make it clear what a mature woman you are!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.580
About what?

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.800
Um... well...

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.670
First, use small talk to get his guard down!

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:09.880
Then ask about his ability!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.300
W-Well...

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:14.260
It's about your real ability.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:20.480
C-Crap!

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.230
What's wrong with you?!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.940
You can't just go there first thing!

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.730
Wh-What I just said...

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:30.530
Did you just say... my real ability?

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:32.610
What did you mean?

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:34.830
That's right...

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:38.950
For both of us, our lives depend
on keeping our ability secret.

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:40.960
I knew that, and yet...

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.630
That's right, I never thanked Akira.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.340
He's the only one who came to save me.

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.050
There he is!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.590
Stay calm.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.510
You can still fix this.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:55.050
My trump card...

00:15:55.800 --> 00:16:00.220
My ability is the ability to
learn another person's ability.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:05.150
For instance, Mr. Kumagiri's is to become
invincible for two seconds, right?

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.740
Why are you saying all this to me?

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.700
H-He's so close!

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.450
T-To be more precise...

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:24.000
My ability is the ability to copy the other
person's ability at one-tenth values.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.210
But in the process of using it,

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.130
I can learn what the other
person's ability is.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:28.670
And?

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:32.550
This ability... It's almost
useless to me on my own.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:35.220
I need a partner.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:38.640
I think your ability is the same way.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.810
Is she serious?

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:42.100
You...

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:46.310
Please, let me be your partner.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:49.150
You were a prisoner of Team Red.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.740
Does that mean you know their abilities, too?

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:14.340
Key... no, Akira.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:18.390
I'm the person most cut
out to be your partner.

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.610
Good morning.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:33.860
Sorry to ask, but could we
spend the day together?

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:36.030
Sure. What are we doing?

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.870
I want to go see Team Blue.

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:42.080
I have to talk with Kumagiri a while,

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.790
so get ready to head out while I do.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:44.870
Wait!

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.210
I don't get it.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:53.380
I've got no idea what's
going through his head.

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.090
The boss...

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:00.100
Where's the boss?

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:02.510
You're the one from the slave hunt.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.890
Tachibana...

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:07.060
I was captured by Green...
and managed to escape.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:10.060
There's something I need
to tell the boss at once!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:14.690
I can imagine what Shirasagi will do.

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:16.740
The quintuple girl is no issue.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:19.950
The real issue is that boy.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.910
Rin! We brought you some water!

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.330
Oh, thanks so much!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:25.920
Oh, Mitsuru!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.960
I wonder what you could be doing...

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:31.090
R-Renka!

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:32.840
You're back?

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:36.550
I was told to participate
in tomorrow's quest.

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:40.010
It's like you're all
hopeless without me here!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:42.430
W-We really are!

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:45.470
Hey, Mitsuru! Who's this here?

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:47.140
My name is Rin Kashii.

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.020
I arrived a few days ago.

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:49.730
It's a pleasu—

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:55.150
Who told you to speak?

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.110
You old whore...

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:58.200
Not good.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.820
Renka's cattiness reveals itself!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:03.160
Why aren't you a slave?

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:06.290
You moved in while I was out,
huh, ya little minx?

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:11.250
Better get outta my sight if
you don't wanna die, ugly.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.000
I'm so sorry.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.590
I'll be more careful in the future,

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.300
Renka dear.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.130
I'll murder you!

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:21.390
Keep it down, Renka.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:22.260
Too much noise.

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.280
Master Masaya!

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:26.470
Your darling Renka has returned!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:29.350
Do you have a present for me?

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.440
I'd love your knife of love!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:32.860
I said to keep it down.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:35.440
If he called Renka here, that means...

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:40.780
Oh, hey, Kuro.

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.570
Let me precede by saying,

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:44.370
Kamui, don't make trouble here.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:46.160
M-Mr. Kamui...

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.160
May I take your skateboard?

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:48.620
No need.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.170
Unnecessary toys are broken
down and disposed of.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.800
That's how I do things.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.050
Masaya!

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:03.760
Yuuki?

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.220
Where's Rindou?

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:06.720
Um...

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:10.430
He took a bunch of the surplus hostages...

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.980
To test his sword for the upcoming battle.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:19.280
Very well.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:23.450
You'll be my pawns in the
upcoming battle quest.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:28.700
Just do as I tell you,
and kill anyone you come across.

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:31.580
Kill everyone you meet with your abilities!

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:34.120
Oh, Masaya!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.750
This guy was captured by Green and escaped.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.590
The spy you have in Green helped me escape.

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:43.300
With a message.

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:44.220
What is it?

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:49.600
They apparently saw the moment the
cannon-user killed the giant ghoul.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:52.140
Though you probably couldn't see it.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:55.980
The child should have been
killed in the attack.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:57.730
But he was fine for some reason.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:00.280
And the next instant, he fired off his cannon.

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:02.240
That's the message.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:11.120
Playing with ghouls again, Ichi?

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.160
Takes me back to old times.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:17.130
I'm going to change the
plan for battle slightly.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.840
Do you remember Akira Shiroyanagi?

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:25.550
I mentioned that he probably had
something other than the cannon...

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:28.010
And I was right.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.400
His cannon is a fake out.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:33.870
His real ability isn't the cannon.

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:12.900
Mion and Yang's Next Episode Preview!

00:23:12.900 --> 00:23:16.280
Did you enjoy the seventh episode
of <i>Battle Game in 5 Seconds</i>?

00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:18.370
It's revealed that Akira's
ability isn't the cannon!

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:21.910
Yuuri and Team Blue's leader
Iori Omoto—Miss Mion!

00:23:22.990 --> 00:23:24.450
You were sleeping, weren't you?

00:23:24.450 --> 00:23:25.690
W-Was not!

00:23:25.690 --> 00:23:27.430
Then what was I saying?

00:23:28.270 --> 00:23:30.250
Moe moe dokyuun! Meow, meow!

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:32.470
Moe moe dokyuun! Meow, meow!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:33.280
Was that it?

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:36.280
Sorry! I was sleeping!

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:37.060
That's better!

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:38.320
See you next time!

00:23:38.320 --> 00:23:39.600
Hope you enjoy...
